        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Heavy Duty Store Front Concealed Door Closer</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThe Concealed LCN Model 2030 Series \"PACER\" is a heavy duty closer designed to fit in a narrow, minimum 1 3/4\" aluminum transom. Reference# cast on the closer housing is 1038G\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=LCN Door Closer Parts\"><b>LCN Door Closer Replacement Parts</b></a> including <a href=\"/products/standard-door-closer-wheel-for-lcn-2030-series-lcn-2030-3034-n\"><b>2030-3034 Door Closer Wheel</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/door-closer-track-for-lcn-2030-series-lcn-2030-3038\"><b>2030-3038 Door Closer Track</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/door-closer-arm-for-lcn-2030-series-lcn-2030-3077t\"><b>LCN 2030 Series Door Closer Arm</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-5200-size.gif?v=1704354599\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"LCN 2030 closer dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>The LCN 2030 Series is available in 3 different spring sizes:\r\n<br>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>LCN-2033 - Size 3</b> for Exterior Doors 28\" - 30\" and Interior Doors 34\" - 38\"</li>\r\n<li><b>LCN-2034 - Size 4</b> for Exterior Doors 30\" - 36\" and Interior Doors 38\" - 48\"</li>\r\n<li><b>LCN-2035 - Size 5</b> for Exterior Doors 36\" - 42\" and Interior Doors 48\" - 54\"</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThis Handed door closer is UL and ULC listed for self-closing doors without hold-open and comes with a 15 year warranty.\r\nTested and certified under ANSI Standard A156.4, <b>Grade 1</b>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/2030.pdf?v=1704262218\"><b>LCN 2030 Series Installation Diagram (PDF).</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/2030-info.pdf?v=1704262218\"><b>LCN 2030 Series Information (PDF).</b></a>\r\n</P>\r\n<p>\r\nThe single lever arm and roller assembly provide smooth, quiet door control. Available in Aluminum and Dark Bronze finish.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged complete with closer mounting plate, arm, track, roller wheel and mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Important</b> When selecting <b>Door Hand</b> for this door closer:  \r\n<br>\r\n1. Stand on the <b>Push Side</b> of the door, facing the door. <br>\r\n2. If the \"Pivot Hinge\" is on your \"Left\", choose \"Left Hand Door\". <br>\r\n3. If the \"Pivot Hinge\" is on your \"Right\", choose \"Right Hand Door\". <br>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/closer-handing.gif?v=1704354510\"  width=\"410\" height=\"195\" border=\"0\"alt=\"door handing\">\r\n</p>",
